The MySQL wire-protocol code in this package (packet layouts, handshake and
authentication flow, result set and binary value decoding) is adapted from
Bun's Zig MySQL client:

  https://github.com/oven-sh/bun  commit 7e57e529, src/sql/mysql
  Bun is MIT licensed.

Bun's socket, TLS (BoringSSL) and JavaScriptCore layers were not used; this
package runs on std.Io and std.crypto.tls.
